    X 1 * X 3 + X 2 * X 5, X 2 * X 4 + X 0 * X 5, X 0 * X 1 - X 1 * X 4 + X 2 * X 4 - X 4 * X 5,
    X 1 * X 2 + X 1 * X 3 + X 1 * X 5 + (X 5)^2, (X 2)^2 + X 2 * X 3 + X 2 * X 5 - X 3 * X 5,
    X 0 * X 2 + X 0 * X 3 + X 3 * X 4 + X 0 * X 5} : Set (MvPolynomial (Fin 6) k))

section TargetStmt
